+  "The VM will be automatically restarted if it stops or crashes. Equivalent to \"always running\".": "虚拟机停止或崩溃后会自动重启，用于持续运行的虚拟机。",
+  "The VM is defined but not running. You can start it manually later.": "创建虚拟机配置，随后可手动启动。",
+  "The VM must be started and stopped manually. It will not auto-restart.": "虚拟机由用户手动启动和停止，退出后会保持停止。",
+  "The VM will be restarted only if it exits with an error. Clean shutdowns are final.": "虚拟机只有在异常退出后才会重启，正常关机后保持停止。",
+  "What happens when the node hosting this VM needs to be drained (e.g., during maintenance). \"LiveMigrate\" moves the VM to another node without downtime.": "决定虚拟机所在节点排空时的处理方式，例如节点维护时。LiveMigrate会在虚拟机继续运行的情况下将其迁到其他节点。",
+  "A pre-configured profile defining CPU, memory, and device defaults. Similar to cloud instance types (e.g., m5.large). Simplifies VM creation by applying consistent resource settings.": "预先定义CPU、内存和设备默认值，例如云实例类型m5.large。创建虚拟机时可直接应用统一的资源配置。",
+  "Default settings for a guest OS (disk bus, network model, firmware). Applied automatically when creating a VM, but can be overridden.": "为客户机操作系统预设磁盘总线、网卡型号和固件。创建虚拟机时自动应用，可按需调整。",
+  "Exposes the exact host CPU to the VM. Best performance, but prevents live migration to hosts with different CPUs.": "向虚拟机暴露宿主机CPU的全部特性，可获得最佳性能。热迁移需要目标节点使用相同的CPU。",
+  "Uses a CPU model compatible with the host. Allows live migration to similar hosts while maintaining most features.": "使用与宿主机兼容的CPU型号，保留大部分CPU特性，并支持热迁移到相似的宿主机。",
+  "Allows scheduling more VM memory than physically available. 100% = no overcommit. 200% = VMs can request up to 2× physical RAM. Increases density but risks OOM kills.": "允许调度的虚拟机内存超过物理内存。100%表示不超分，200%表示可申请最多两倍物理内存。内存压力过高时可能触发OOM终止。",
+  "Enables dynamic memory management. The host can reclaim unused memory from the VM when needed. Improves memory utilization across VMs.": "启用动态内存管理。宿主机可按需回收虚拟机未使用的内存，提高整体内存利用率。",
+  "A CDI (Containerized Data Importer) resource that automates creating and populating a PVC from a source like a container image, URL, or another PVC.": "CDI的数据卷资源，可自动创建PVC，并从容器镜像、URL或其他PVC导入数据。",
+  "ReadWriteOnce — the volume can be mounted read-write by a single node. Most common for VM disks. Does not support live migration.": "ReadWriteOnce允许单个节点以读写方式挂载卷，常用于虚拟机磁盘。跨节点热迁移需要其他访问模式。",
+  "ReadWriteMany — the volume can be mounted read-write by multiple nodes simultaneously. Required for live migration.": "ReadWriteMany允许多个节点同时以读写方式挂载卷，用于支持跨节点热迁移。",
+  "ReadOnlyMany — the volume can be mounted read-only by multiple nodes. Useful for shared base images.": "ReadOnlyMany允许多个节点以只读方式挂载卷，适合共享基础镜像。",
+  "The volume is mounted as a directory with a filesystem. Adds a small overhead but supports resizing and snapshots more easily.": "以文件系统目录方式挂载卷。少量额外开销可换取更便捷的扩容和快照支持。",
+  "The volume is exposed as a raw block device. Better performance for I/O-heavy workloads, but no filesystem layer.": "以裸块设备方式提供卷，适合I/O密集型任务，文件系统由使用方管理。",
+  "Pre-allocates the full disk size on creation instead of growing on demand. Improves write performance but uses more storage immediately.": "创建时分配完整磁盘空间，提高写入性能，同时立即占用对应存储空间。",
+  "Determines how the storage is provisioned (e.g., local SSD, network-attached, replicated). Leave empty to use the cluster default.": "决定如何供应存储，例如本地SSD、网络存储或多副本存储。留空时使用集群默认存储类。",
+  "A temporary in-memory disk that exists only while the VM runs. Data is lost on shutdown. Useful for scratch space or swap.": "虚拟机运行时可用的临时内存盘，关机后清空，适合暂存数据或作为交换空间。",
+  "A persistent blank disk backed by a DataVolume. Survives VM restarts. Use for data disks that need to persist.": "由DataVolume提供的空白持久磁盘。虚拟机重启后保留数据，适合用作数据盘。",
+  "A read-only disk image pulled from a container registry (e.g., quay.io). Commonly used for OS boot images. Does not persist writes across reboots.": "从容器镜像仓库拉取的只读磁盘镜像，例如quay.io。常用于启动操作系统，运行期间的写入在重启后丢失。",
+  "Uses a copy-on-write overlay on an existing PVC. Writes are discarded on VM stop. Useful for testing with a base image.": "在现有PVC上使用写时复制层，停止虚拟机后丢弃写入，适合用基础镜像做测试。",
+  "Creates a new disk from a volume snapshot. The snapshot must exist and the storage class must support CSI snapshots.": "根据卷快照创建新磁盘。请确认快照已存在，且存储类支持CSI快照。",
+  "The default cluster network. VMs get a Pod IP and can communicate with other pods and services. Uses NAT for outbound traffic.": "默认集群网络。虚拟机通过Pod的IP地址与其他Pod和Service通信，出站流量经过NAT。",
+  "A secondary network defined by a NetworkAttachmentDefinition. Provides direct L2 access to external networks (VLANs, bridges, SR-IOV).": "由NetworkAttachmentDefinition定义的辅助网络。允许在二层直接访问外部网络，例如VLAN、网桥或SR-IOV网络。",
+  "NAT-based network binding. The VM gets a private IP and the host translates traffic. Simple and works everywhere, but no inbound connections without services.": "基于NAT的网络绑定。虚拟机使用私有IP，宿主机转换地址。接收入站连接需要Service。",
+  "Bridges the VM directly onto the pod network at L2. The VM gets an IP from the pod network. Supports inbound connections but requires permitBridgeInterfaceOnPodNetwork.": "将虚拟机直接二层桥接到Pod网络，并从该网络获取IP。启用permitBridgeInterfaceOnPodNetwork后可接收入站连接。",
+  "SR-IOV passthrough. Assigns a physical network function directly to the VM for near-native network performance. Requires SR-IOV-capable NICs and node configuration.": "将SR-IOV网络功能直通给虚拟机，获得接近原生的网络性能。需要网卡支持SR-IOV并完成节点配置。",
+  "Paravirtualized network adapter. Best performance but requires virtio drivers in the guest OS (included in most Linux distros and Windows virtio drivers).": "半虚拟化网卡，性能较高。客户机需要virtio驱动，大多数Linux发行版已内置，Windows可安装相应驱动。",
+  "Emulated Intel e1000e NIC. Widely compatible with all guest OSes without extra drivers, but lower performance than virtio.": "仿真的Intel e1000e网卡，有较好的客户机兼容性，通常无需额外驱动，性能低于virtio。",
+  "Paravirtualized disk controller. Best performance but requires virtio drivers in the guest OS.": "半虚拟化磁盘控制器，性能较高，需要在客户机中安装virtio驱动。",
+  "Emulated SATA controller. Good compatibility with all guest OSes, moderate performance.": "仿真的SATA控制器，与多数客户机操作系统兼容，性能适中。",
+  "Emulated SCSI controller. Supports features like TRIM/UNMAP and multiple LUNs.": "仿真的SCSI控制器，支持TRIM/UNMAP及多个LUN。",
+  "Modern firmware replacing legacy BIOS. Required for Secure Boot and some newer operating systems.": "新的固件标准。安全启动和某些较新的操作系统需要UEFI。",
+  "Verifies that the OS bootloader is signed by a trusted authority. Prevents rootkits but requires UEFI and compatible OS images.": "验证系统引导程序是否带有可信签名，有助于防止引导阶段的恶意代码。需要UEFI和兼容的操作系统镜像。",
+  "Saves UEFI settings (boot order, Secure Boot keys) across reboots. Without this, UEFI variables reset on each VM start.": "在重启后保留UEFI设置，例如启动顺序和安全启动密钥。关闭时，每次启动虚拟机都会重置UEFI变量。",
+  "Standard cloud-init datasource. Passes user-data (scripts, SSH keys) and network config via a virtual config drive. Works with most cloud images.": "标准cloud-init数据源。通过虚拟配置盘提供用户数据（脚本、SSH密钥等）和网络配置，兼容大多数云镜像。",
+  "OpenStack-compatible config drive format. Also used by Fedora CoreOS with Ignition. Use this for Ignition configs.": "兼容OpenStack的配置盘格式。Fedora CoreOS使用Ignition时也采用这一格式。配置Ignition时请选择此项。",
+  "Virtual socket for host-guest communication without networking. Used by guest agents and monitoring tools for efficient data exchange.": "无需网络即可在宿主机和客户机之间通信的虚拟套接字，供客户机代理和监控工具交换数据。",
+  "Attaches a virtual input device (keyboard/mouse via USB or virtio). Required for VNC console interaction.": "接入USB或virtio虚拟键盘和鼠标，供VNC控制台交互使用。",
+  "Moves a running VM to another node without downtime. Requires RWX storage and compatible CPU models across nodes.": "将运行中的虚拟机迁到其他节点。需要RWX存储，且源节点和目标节点的CPU型号兼容。",
+  "Throttles the VM CPU during live migration to help memory pages converge faster. Useful when migration stalls due to high memory write rate.": "热迁移时降低虚拟机CPU速度，让内存页更快同步。适用于内存写入频繁导致迁移停滞的情况。",
+  "Transfers remaining memory pages on-demand after switching the VM to the target node. Faster completion but risks VM pause if pages arrive slowly.": "虚拟机切换到目标节点后，按需传输剩余内存页。可缩短切换等待时间，内存页传输过慢时虚拟机可能暂停。",
+  "When the snapshot is deleted, the underlying volume snapshots are also deleted. Frees storage but the snapshot cannot be recovered.": "删除快照时同时删除底层卷快照，释放存储空间。删除后无法使用这些快照恢复数据。",
+  "When the snapshot is deleted, the underlying volume snapshots are kept. Uses more storage but allows recovery.": "删除快照后仍保留底层卷快照，用于后续恢复。这些卷快照会继续占用存储空间。",
+  "Maximum time to wait for the snapshot to complete. If exceeded, the snapshot is marked as failed.": "等待快照完成的最长时间，超时后将快照标记为失败。",
+  "How long the export remains available for download before being automatically cleaned up.": "导出文件可供下载的时长，到期后自动清理。",
+  "Overwrites the current VM disks with the snapshot contents. The VM must be stopped. All changes since the snapshot are lost.": "用快照内容覆盖当前虚拟机磁盘。请先停止虚拟机。创建快照后所做的修改将丢失。",
+  "Creates a new VM from the snapshot, leaving the original VM untouched.": "从快照创建一台新虚拟机，原虚拟机继续保留。",
+  "Assigns a physical PCI device (GPU, NIC, accelerator) directly to the VM. The device is exclusively used by the VM and unavailable to the host.": "将GPU、网卡或加速卡等物理PCI设备直通给虚拟机，由该虚拟机独占。",
+  "A virtual device (vGPU) created by partitioning a physical device. Multiple VMs can share one physical GPU. Requires vendor drivers (e.g., NVIDIA vGPU).": "从物理设备划分出的虚拟设备（vGPU），让多台虚拟机可以共享同一块GPU。需要厂商驱动，例如NVIDIA vGPU驱动。",
+  "Enable when a third-party device plugin (e.g., NVIDIA GPU Operator) manages this device. KubeVirt will permit the device but delegate allocation and health monitoring to the external plugin.": "当设备由第三方设备插件（例如NVIDIA GPU Operator）管理时启用。KubeVirt允许使用该设备，由外部插件负责分配和健康检查。",
+  "The PCI vendor and device ID in hexadecimal (e.g., 10DE:1DB6). Find it with \"lspci -nn\" on the host node.": "PCI厂商ID和设备ID为十六进制格式，例如10DE:1DB6。可在宿主机上运行lspci -nn查看。",
+  "Moves VM disk data from one storage class to another while the VM is running. Requires the target storage to support the same or compatible access modes.": "在虚拟机运行时将磁盘数据迁移至其他存储类。目标存储需要支持相同或兼容的访问模式。",
+  "One or more disks use ReadWriteOnce (RWO) access mode, which cannot be accessed from multiple nodes simultaneously. Convert to ReadWriteMany (RWX) to enable live migration.": "至少一块磁盘使用ReadWriteOnce（RWO）模式，只能由单一节点挂载。改用ReadWriteMany（RWX）后即可支持热迁移。",
+  "Source Configuration": "来源配置",
