+  "Supported formats: qcow2, raw, ISO, vmdk (auto-detected). The": "支持自动识别qcow2、raw、ISO和vmdk格式。请使用",
+  "flag is needed because the port-forward uses a self-signed certificate.": "参数，因为端口转发使用自签名证书。",
